Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
10.10 Export the four plot families and scalar eigenstate data\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1a94716a-a68e-9c42-815f-1917292c758c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"zzDir", "=", 
   RowBox[{"newFolder", "[", 
    RowBox[{"zzOutputRoot", ",", 
     RowBox[{"zzRunLabel", "<>", "\"\<_L\>\"", "<>", 
      RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
       RowBox[{"zzUsed", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "<>", "\n", 
      " ", "\"\<_J\>\"", "<>", 
      RowBox[{"safeToken", "[", 
       RowBox[{"zzUsed", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
      "<>", "\"\<_Delta\>\"", "<>", 
      RowBox[{"safeToken", "[", 
       RowBox[{"zzUsed", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"edgeSave", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "zzDir", ",", "zzUsed", ",", "\"\<ZZ\>\"", ",", "zzGUsed", ",", "zzGroups",
     ",", "zzResults", ",", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<spectrum\>\"", ",", "zzSpectrumPlots"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<half_entropy\>\"", ",", "zzHalfPlots"}], "}"}], ",", "\n",
       "  ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<edge_bulk_entropy\>\"", ",", "zzEdgePlots"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<ipr\>\"", ",", "zzIPRPlots"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
    "zzSettingsUsed"}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[147]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a6ee3e86-861e-9543-9000-efbe2f879df8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Saved: \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", \
"\<\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Miguel\\\\Documents\\\\GitHub\\\\Spin-transport\\\\xxz_\
impurities_characterization\\\\xxz_edge_coupling_results\\\\ZZ_L10_J1_\
Delta0p5\"\>"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "Saved: ", 
   "C:\\Users\\Miguel\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spin-transport\\xxz_impurities_\
characterization\\xxz_edge_coupling_results\\ZZ_L10_J1_Delta0p5"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0009396453414116`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[147]:=",ExpressionUUID->"92a9ff73-4561-044f-bdb5-1cd9bdb6e9b7"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
To inspect a full eigenket at one g without rerunning the sweep: \
zzOneED=zzEdgeED[1/10,zzUsed,zzSettingsUsed[\"EDTolerance\"]]; then use the \
unchanged sectorTable[zzOneED] and eigenket[zzOneED,sector,level]. Rerun 10.4 \
onward for a new parameter set; no kernel reset is needed. Every spectrum, \
entropy, and IPR plot uses Joined->False and all supplied g values. The \
g-axis ticks are readable axis labels, not a second sampling grid. MarkerSize \
defaults to 3 points in zzSettings; open partner markers are slightly larger. \
For a style-only update, reevaluate the shared definitions in 10.2 and the \
plot/export cells with the retained data. Changing zzGGrid requires \
recomputing 10.5. Matching spectra do not impose matching eigenstate \
observables.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"49e253c8-16e2-0245-8924-295d3eda1a0c"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
10.10a Export the additional ZZ audit and endpoint diagnostics\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"5c5a312d-12f4-2141-8ef6-b0a508bc60a9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"check", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"StringQ", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"zzDir", ",", "\"\<sector_audit.wxf\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<Model\>\"", "->", "zzUsed"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<gGrid\>\"", "->", "zzGUsed"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<SetupAudit\>\"", "->", "zzSetupAudit"}], ",", "\n", 
         "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<BlockReductionAudit\>\"", "->", "zzBlockAudit"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<PointAudits\>\"", "->", "zzAuditTable"}], ",", "\n", 
         "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<EndpointReports\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
           RowBox[{"zzResults", ",", "\"\<EndpointReport\>\""}], "]"}]}]}], 
        "|>"}], ",", "\"\<WXF\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
    " ", "\"\<ZZ sector-audit export failed.\>\""}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[149]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0f9e39cd-9e95-da44-b95d-a7e4e71cd472"]
}, Closed]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
11. Weak exchange-only coupling of the two edge spins: eigenstate g sweep\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"10ffbf8a-df3c-364f-946b-1098e3a74c2e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["11.1 Model and remaining symmetry sectors", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"9d4324b3-dfe7-3c4c-aa27-ae4ff63a7a6a"],

Cell["\<\
Here exchange ONLY means the XY (flip-flop) term, with no ZZ interaction on \
either edge bond:
H_exchange(g)=H_bulk+g(S_1^x S_2^x+S_1^y S_2^y+S_(L-1)^x S_L^x+S_(L-1)^y \
S_L^y).
NOTE ON THE USUAL LADDER-OPERATOR EXCHANGE: sigma^+=(sigma^x+i \
sigma^y)/2={{0,1},{0,0}}, sigma^-=(sigma^x-i sigma^y)/2={{0,0},{1,0}}. They \
equal S^+=S^x+i S^y and S^-=S^x-i S^y with the original S=sigma/2 convention. \
Thus S_i^x S_j^x+S_i^y S_j^y=(sigma_i^+ sigma_j^-+sigma_i^- sigma_j^+)/2. The \
edge interaction in this chapter is exactly (g/2)(sigma_1^+ \
sigma_2^-+sigma_1^- sigma_2^+ + sigma_(L-1)^+ sigma_L^-+sigma_(L-1)^- \
sigma_L^+). The matrix element |up,down> <-> |down,up> is g/2. If a different \
paper writes lambda(sigma_i^+ sigma_j^-+sigma_i^- sigma_j^+), its lambda \
equals g/2 here. The code retains the original spin-operator convention \
rather than silently changing the normalization of g.
H_bulk, S=sigma/2, the meaning of g, and zero fields are the same as in 10.1. \
This is an edge XY exchange, not a full Heisenberg or full XXZ edge bond. The \
two original XXZ edge bonds are again replaced.
For g!=0 the individual edge S^z values and the bulk magnetization are no \
longer conserved. Total magnetization M=Sum_i S_i^z remains conserved. Equal \
edge couplings preserve reflection R, and zero fields preserve global spin \
flip F. R and F commute, but F maps m to -m, so the simultaneously resolved \
labels are (m,r) for m!=0 and (m=0,r,f) for m=0. Each r,f is +/-1. A \
magnetization block has dimension Binomial[L,L/2-m] before \
reflection/spin-flip splitting. F gives equal-spectrum opposite-m partners \
rather than another label inside a nonzero-m block.
No full-chain S^2 label is used at Delta=+/-1 because the edge XY anisotropy \
breaks that symmetry. At g=0 the edges decouple and compatible extra \
edge/bulk charges are automatically resolved as in 10.2; the parent (m,r,f) \
labels remain fixed for the sweep. Since exactly degenerate states can be \
chosen in different eigenbases, endpoint entropies and IPR are not unique \
without this symmetry choice. In particular, F-resolved states at g=0 can be \
superpositions involving different edge magnetizations. For Delta=0 the \
entire model is an inhomogeneous XX chain with a free-fermion description; \
this is an additional special integrable limit, not a reason to assume the \
two interacting models have identical generic sectors.
The two chapters have independent parameters, results, plotting arrays, and \
output folders. To run chapter 11 alone, evaluate original definitions 1-2 \
and shared definitions 10.2, then 11.2 onward. The ZZ sweep is not required.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2796e543-d03a-1e47-abc4-448c67877df2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
11.2 Exchange Hamiltonian and magnetization/reflection sectors\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"41a1cb28-727f-b547-989d-c86097312abc"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "exEdgeH", ",", "exEdgeSpaces", ",", "exEdgeSetup", ",", "exEdgeED"}], 
   "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeH", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", "p_Association"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"b", "=", 
       RowBox[{"edgeBonds", "[", 
        RowBox[{"edgeModel", "[", "p", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"realQ", "[", "g", "]"}], 
        ",", "\"\<g must be finite and real.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"b", "[", "\"\<Bulk\>\"", "]"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"g", " ", 
         RowBox[{"b", "[", "\"\<Exchange\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeSpaces", "[", 
    RowBox[{"p_", ",", "tol_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"l", "=", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "bits", ",", "q", ",", 
       "ids", ",", "m", ",", "names", ",", "spaces", ",", 
       RowBox[{"out", "=", 
        RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"bits", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"IntegerDigits", "[", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", "2", ",", "l"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", "0", ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"q", "=", 
       RowBox[{"KeyTake", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"charges", "[", "p", "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", ",", "\"\<F\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"m", "=", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", "nDown"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"ids", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
             RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
               RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "==", "nDown"}], 
             "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"names", "=", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"m", "==", "0"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", ",", "\"\<F\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", "\"\<R\>\"", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"spaces", "=", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"<|", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\"\<Basis\>\"", "->", 
              RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", 
               RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ids", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", 
              RowBox[{"<|", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", "->", "m"}], "|>"}]}]}], "|>"}], "}"}]}], 
         ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"spaces", "=", 
            RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"splitCharge", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"q", "[", "name", "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"ids", ",", "ids"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",",
                   "name", ",", "tol"}], "]"}], "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
               "spaces"}], ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"name", ",", "names"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"out", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
           RowBox[{"out", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
               RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                RowBox[{"<|", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<Indices\>\"", "->", "ids"}], "|>"}]}], "]"}], 
              "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "spaces"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"nDown", ",", "0", ",", "l"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "out"}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeSetup", "[", 
    RowBox[{"p_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"edgeSetup", "[", 
    RowBox[{"p", ",", "\"\<Exchange\>\"", ",", "exEdgeSpaces", ",", "tol"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeED", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", "p_Association", ",", 
     RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"edgeED", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g", ",", 
     RowBox[{"exEdgeSetup", "[", 
      RowBox[{"p", ",", "tol"}], "]"}], ",", "tol"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[150]:=",ExpressionUUID->"57e15372-1c3d-ff46-acbc-d4ad383634eb"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["11.3 Editable exchange sweep parameters", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"23b0282a-a068-3040-a6a5-21d381ed577f"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exModel", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "10"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", "->", "1"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", "->", "0.5"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exGGrid", "=", 
    RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", "1.", ",", "0.005"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "   ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "multiplies", " ", "SxSx"}], "+", "SySy"}], ";", " ", 
    RowBox[{"the", " ", "ladder", " ", "coefficient", " ", "is", " ", 
     RowBox[{"g", "/", "2."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exSettings", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<MatchingTolerance\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "8"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<PlotChop\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<MarkerSize\>\"", "->", "3"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exParallel", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<Enabled\>\"", "->", "True"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Kernels\>\"", "->", "12"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exOutputRoot", "=", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"baseFolder", "[", "]"}], 
      ",", "\"\<xxz_edge_coupling_results\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRunLabel", "=", "\"\<Exchange\>\""}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.0008806796009827`*^9, {4.0009341789286823`*^9, 4.0009341949700584`*^9}, {
   4.0009343572281933`*^9, 4.0009343573067417`*^9}, {4.000934453866478*^9, 
   4.0009344542199497`*^9}, {4.0009345920376244`*^9, 
   4.0009346057450523`*^9}, {4.000939726880493*^9, 4.0009397553167534`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[155]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7d439ce2-f1a4-e24c-9099-e919d7327f24"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
11.4 Compute all eigenpairs, both entropies, and IPR at every g\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"fb336b5b-b48e-f843-bb25-955c3a08d0e1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exUsed", "=", 
   RowBox[{"edgeModel", "[", "exModel", "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"exGUsed", "=", "exGGrid"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"exSettingsUsed", "=", "exSettings"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"exParallelUsed", "=", "exParallel"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"check", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Length", "[", "exGUsed", "]"}], ">=", "2"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
     RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
      RowBox[{"exGUsed", ",", "realQ"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"And", "@@", 
      RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Differences", "[", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", "exGUsed", "]"}], "]"}], ">", "0"}], "]"}]}]}], 
    ",", "\"\<Exchange g grid must be real and strictly increasing.\>\""}], 
   "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exSetup", "=", 
   RowBox[{"exEdgeSetup", "[", 
    RowBox[{"exUsed", ",", 
     RowBox[{"exSettingsUsed", "[", "\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"exSeconds", ",", "exResults"}], "}"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"AbsoluteTiming", "[", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{"edgeSweep", "[", 
     RowBox[{"exGUsed", ",", "exSetup", ",", 
      RowBox[{"exSettingsUsed", "[", "\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
      "exParallelUsed"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exData", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
    RowBox[{"exResults", ",", "\"\<Data\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exKeys", "=", 
   RowBox[{"edgeSweepCheck", "[", 
    RowBox[{"exResults", ",", "exGUsed", ",", "exUsed"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exGroups", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Gather", "[", 
    RowBox[{"exKeys", ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sameSpectrum", "[", 
       RowBox[{"#1", ",", "#2", ",", "exData", ",", 
        RowBox[{"exSettingsUsed", "[", "\"\<MatchingTolerance\>\"", "]"}]}], 
       "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Exchange sweep seconds: \>\"", ",", "exSeconds", 
    ",", "\"\<; parent sectors: \>\"", ",", 
    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "exKeys", "]"}], ",", "\n", 
    " ", "\"\<; plotted groups: \>\"", ",", 
    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "exGroups", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Dataset", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"First", "[", "exResults", "]"}], "[", "\"\<SectorTable\>\"", 
   "]"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[161]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6c126fcb-3f56-5c42-ace9-a0f1d4d50a33"],

